op15_nonmonotone.py -- OP-15: non-monotone alphabets in the inverse complexity problem
Values            : 12 rationals +-j/6, j=1..6
Pattern lengths   : (2, 3, 4)
Truncation N      : 1024 (periodic family)
Targets (family L): ['1', '7/8', '1/2', '3/4']
Targets (family P): ['1', '7/8']

