  alpha_n = v_(n mod k); target x in {1, 7/8}
  The word length is N for every pattern; p(L) is computed for 1 <= L <= N.
  CLASSIFICATION (proved, not observed):
    * all-positive pattern  -> at most x/min(v) takes -> FINITE support
      (r is non-increasing, each take costs >= min v > 0, r >= 0 always)
    * signed pattern        -> every negative term is always taken ->
      INFINITE support; a zero residual is NOT absorbing (the next
      negative term re-triggers), so no signed periodic pattern halts.

